+From 3acfa5b8bb3ff0a6fb53816f82a7f37bff3d5539 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Romain Naour <romain.naour@gmail.com>
+Date: Tue, 5 May 2020 01:23:29 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH] Revert "CMake: Replace FindSDL2.cmake by sdl2-config.cmake
+ (#1530)"
+
+This reverts commit 6de6f9b4081a07c911932441700c54b72ec1ee1f.
+
+The sdl2-config.cmake generated by sdl2 package is broken for
+cross-compilation since it add /usr/include/SDL2 in CFLAGS.
+
+Such flags are unsafe for cross-compilation since it mixes
+headers for the host and target.
+
+sdl2-config.cmake must be avoided until upstream bug is fixed
+[1].
+
+[1] https://bugzilla.libsdl.org/show_bug.cgi?id=4597
+
+Upstream status:
+https://github.com/OGRECave/ogre/issues/1568
+
+Signed-off-by: Romain Naour <romain.naour@gmail.com>
